# Spiked Apple Cider

{ rating="3" image="spiked_cider.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 cups [apple cider]{ ing="apple-cider" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [rum]{ ing="rum" }
- [ ] [Optional]{ ing="optional" }

      - [ ] 1/2 teaspoon [whole cloves]{ ing="whole-cloves" }
      - [ ] 1/4 teaspoon [allspice]{ ing="allspice" }
      - [ ] 1 pinch [nutmeg]{ ing="nutmeg" }
      - [ ] 2 tsp [light brown sugar]{ ing="light-brown-sugar" }
- [ ] [Orange slices]{ ing="orange-slices" }, garnish

## Recipe

1. In a pot, heat the [cider]{ ing="apple-cider" } and any chosen spices
1. Add the [rum]{ ing="rum" } and serve hot with an [Orange slice]{ ing="orange-slices" } garnish

## Notes

- We used Bacardi Gold when making this the first time

## Warnings

- *If using spices, make sure to filter before pouring*
